{"id":"substance","lemma":"substance","pos":"noun","rank":4024,"glosses":["substance"],"ipa":"/syp.stɑ̃s/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/98/Fr-substance.ogg/Fr-substance.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"substances"},"formAudio":{"substances":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/93/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-substances.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Il est dangereux de mélanger ces substances.","en":"It's dangerous to mix these substances.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"dangerous"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to mix, to mix up"},{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},null]},{"text":"L'amiante est une substance cancérigène.","en":"Asbestos is a carcinogen.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"asbestos"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},null,null]},{"text":"J'aimerais savoir comment ces substances sont absorbées par le corps.","en":"I would like to know how these substances are absorbed by the body.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to love","l":"aimer"},{"g":"to know"},{"g":"how"},{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"être"},null,{"g":"through"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"body"}]},{"text":"Une substance visqueuse coulait du tuyau.","en":"Slime was oozing out of the pipe.","words":[{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"viscous","l":"visqueux"},{"g":"to sink","l":"couler"},{"g":"of the / some"},{"g":"pipe"}]},{"text":"Consommez-vous des substances illicites ?","en":"Do you use any illegal substances?","words":[null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null,{"g":"illicit","l":"illicite"}]}]}